From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:18:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Dump: DumpPage is the page's container, with a page
 context

DumpScreen becomes DumpPage and provides DumpPageContext (capture, its
error, loadMore): DumpComposer takes no props, DumpFeed takes the entries
and their paging state. The route's unwrapping of the first page and its
week fallback move into the pure adapter toDumpPageProps (utils/dump.ts,
unit-tested), which the dump scenarios run on their fixtures too.

